LICENCE NOT YET SELECTED
========================

The maintainer of PharmaDesk has not chosen an open-source licence yet.

This file is a deliberate placeholder. It is NOT a licence and grants no
rights. Until it is replaced with the text of a real licence, default
copyright applies: all rights are reserved by the copyright holder, and no
permission is given to use, copy, modify or distribute this software.

To the maintainer - choose one, then replace this whole file with its full
official text and update the "license" field in package.json,
backend/package.json and src-tauri/Cargo.toml, and the Licence section of
README.md:

  MIT          Short and permissive. Anyone may use the code, including in
               closed-source products, if they keep the copyright notice.

  Apache-2.0   Permissive like MIT, plus an explicit patent grant and a
               requirement to state changes.

  GPL-3.0      Copyleft. Anyone distributing a modified version must publish
               its source under the same licence.

  AGPL-3.0     Like GPL-3.0, and also applies when a modified version is
               offered to users over a network (relevant to the backend).

Official texts: https://choosealicense.com/licenses/

Note: accepting outside contributions before a licence is chosen makes the
choice harder later, because each contributor keeps the copyright in their
own contribution.
